# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# purkinjeNetwork.dat columns: $1 time, $2..$4 junction 2, 3, 4 IcouplingSource [A/m3],
# $5.. node0.. Vm [V].
# Root stimulated at 0.01 s: depolarised shortly after.
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.015  5  0.0241431534   1e-6
# Root stimulated again at 0.3 s, during recovery from the first beat.
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.305  5  -0.0626353566  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.305  7  -0.0758957031  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.305  9  -0.0709806861  1e-6
# Junction current into the tissue.
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.305  2  -6041.88396    5
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.305  4  -6191.65009    5
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.320  2  -1028.87739    5
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.320  4  -1507.08188    5
